OL,3,ABBC tracks down businessman at centre
OL,4,Aof council scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has tracked down businessman
OL,7,FLiam Kavanagh to a luxury apartment in
OL,8,FBucharest. His whereabouts had remained
OL,9,Flargely unknown for years following his
OL,10,Frole in one of the biggest financial
OL,11,Fscandals in British local government
OL,12,Fhistory.
OL,14,FThurrock Council in Essex invested more
OL,15,Fthan #600m in Kavanagh's solar energy
OL,16,Fbusinesses - despite stark warnings
OL,17,Fthat the investments were too risky.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
