OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABBC tracks down businessman at centre
OL,4,Aof council scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith the money he received, Kavanagh
OL,7,Fbought a #12m private jet, a yacht, a
OL,8,Ffleet of supercars, a country house
OL,9,Fadored by Jane Austen, a Damien Hirst
OL,10,Fpickled sheep artwork and a #250,000
OL,11,Frevolving bed.
OL,13,FThen it all came crashing down.
OL,14,FThurrock was left with a vast financial
OL,15,Fblack hole and effectively went
OL,16,Fbankrupt, forcing central government to
OL,17,Fstep in with hundreds of millions of
OL,18,Fpounds of taxpayers' money.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
